# Library unit A of the two-unit link row (FABLE-L2-LIBRARY-P2-UNIQUE-STATE-20260921-137).
# No main: l2trans takes it in library mode.  The constant is NON-ZERO on purpose: an exported
# wrapper that cannot open its unit returns 0 today, so a zero here could never tell "ran" from "refused".
fn: lib_pair_a_value () int
    return: 41
